# Settings the production agent runs with, beside agent.keys (render_env.py). Each is a Doppler key there.
# The staged policy keeps a first-time caller from writing files or running code (api/app.py); render_env.py
# refuses a production env where it is allow or missing. The trust thresholds decide when a caller graduates.
ACP_PERMISSION_POLICY
AGENT_TRUST_MIN_TASKS
AGENT_TRUST_ACCRUAL_SECS
E2B_SLOT_CAPACITY
